  "question": {
    "text": "<math><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></math> is a vertical tower. The point <math><mi>A</mi></math> is on the ground and <math><mi>C</mi></math> is the middle point of <math><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></math>. The part <math><mi>C</mi><mi>B</mi></math> subtend an angle <math><mi>α</mi></math> at a point <math><mi>P</mi></math> on the ground. If <math><mi>A</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></math>, then the correct relation is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan&nbsp;</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>&alpha;</mi></mrow></mrow></math>",
